# New text editor

The text editor has been replaced. You can now lay out [newsletters](/newsletters) and the texts members see on the site more clearly. The same editor is used in [settings](/settings) and in the other places where you write those texts.

You can now:

- choose a heading size (large, medium, or small)
- highlight a word or a sentence in a color
- insert a table
- insert a divider

Links, lists, and images are still there. Text you already saved stays as it is.

If something looks odd or does not work as expected, please [let me know](/support_tickets/new), with a screenshot if you can. Thank you!
